Backdrop (AndroidLiquidGlass)
-----------------------------

The AGSL shaders in extensions/liquidglass (GlassShaders.java) and the parameters of the
glass effect are ported from Backdrop by Kyant (https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass).
libs/backdrop and libs/backdrop-catalog contain copies of its source files, unchanged, from
commit 65ab177e (see libs/README.md); only the Gradle build files around them are ours.
LiquidBottomTabs, LiquidButton, LiquidSlider and LiquidToggle come from its catalog app.

